    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500910/extras/81e52a409f91181152abe6d6b96c828b.avif?t=1713252618\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gather &amp; Manage resources (Wood, Stone and Food)<br></li><li>Progress through an Open World to fight and settle camps to gather resources and get new technologies<br></li><li>Expand your settlement<br></li><li>Order your workers to build &amp; upgrade<br></li><li>Research new technologies<br></li><li>Build Walls to block enemies' path<br></li><li>Train Javeliners, Archers, Knights, Shielders, Scorpions, Catapults, Trebuchets..<br></li><li>Siege enemy camps/villages/castles<br></li><li>Build ships to get past the enemy walls and build fishing boats to gather Food</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500910/extras/fa5829f3b21229720607e32089061b00.poster.avif?t=1713252618\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500910/extras/fa5829f3b21229720607e32089061b00.webm?t=1713252618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500910/extras/fa5829f3b21229720607e32089061b00.mp4?t=1713252618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
